              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.27.26+EZK.27.27+EZK.27.28+EZK.27.29+EZK.27.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esek 27:26-30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵaliweni lyosi lyakutyocela mwilamba lya moto pa ndaŵi jele msindawo waliji mkupya, ni ŵagumisile kuti, “Pangali msinda uwalandenepo ni msinda wakupikanikawu?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.27.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esek 27:32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵalitasile luwundu m'mitwe mwawo, aku ali mkulila kulosya canasa. Ŵagumilaga kuti, “Ukwete likungu, ukwete likungu msinda wakupikanikawu, msinda wele ŵandu wosope ŵakwete yombo ŵasicile mnope ni cipanje cakwe. Nambo kwandaŵi jamnono msindawu utendekwe kuŵa masame.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
