              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msangalale, kwinani, ligongo lyakuti Mlungu ajonasile msinda wa Babiloni. Ŵandu ŵa Mlungu pamo ni ndumetume, ni ŵakulocesya ŵakwe, pakuti Mlungu apelece cilango kwa ŵandu ŵa mu msindawo ligongo lya yindu yiŵatesile kwa jemanja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.20"
            ]
          }
